zh.instructions:
请通过这台电脑上的黎猫工具箱 Agent接口管理 DeepSeek Harness。
地址：{address}
密钥：{key}

使用 HTTP JSON。每个请求加请求头 Authorization: Bearer <上述密钥>。先 GET /v1/status 和 GET /v1/operations，按返回的实际能力与参数操作，不要猜测接口。
修改操作使用新的 UUID 作为 X-Request-ID，收到 202 后查询 /v1/jobs/<requestId>。重复请求沿用同一 ID，断线不代表成功；自更新、停用或退出可能断线，可读取本机任务回执确认。
Profile：{profile}
回执目录：Profile/.tanuki-toolbox/agent-interface/jobs。
可读取状态、组件/插件列表、工具箱设置及接口操作日志；可调整开关/设置，安装、更新、移除插件和重新加载。源码修改使用你自己的本机文件工具，然后调用安装或重新加载。正常退出和重启以 desktop 状态及原生任务检查为准，不强制结束进程，不操作鼠标。
接口关闭时禁止连接，再次开启沿用当前地址和密钥。仅连接运行插件的这台电脑的 127.0.0.1 接口，不需要 DSH 登录 Cookie。

en.instructions:
Manage DeepSeek Harness through the Tanuki Toolbox Agent Interface on this computer.
Address: {address}
Key: {key}

Use HTTP JSON and Authorization: Bearer <the key above> on every request. First GET /v1/status and GET /v1/operations; use the returned capabilities and request shapes instead of guessing endpoints.
For mutations, send a fresh UUID in X-Request-ID. After HTTP 202, query /v1/jobs/<requestId>. Retry the same operation with the same ID. A disconnect is not proof of success; self-update, disabling or quitting may disconnect HTTP, so inspect the local receipt when needed.
Profile: {profile}
Receipts: Profile/.tanuki-toolbox/agent-interface/jobs.
Read status, plugin/component inventory, Toolbox settings and API action logs; change switches/settings, install/update/remove plugins and reload the profile. Edit source using your own local file tools, then install or reload. Graceful quit/restart depends on desktop adapter availability and native task checks. Never force-kill DSH or operate the mouse for these actions.
Disabling blocks connections; re-enabling retains this address and key. Connect to 127.0.0.1 on the computer running the plugin. No DSH login cookie is needed.
